WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0112: camera.bin says whether WoW's world round the eye is loaded.
A far switch to a party member (AI Context/multi-world-design.md phase 2) moved BG3's camera, and benilla's with it, to
a place whose world streams only once the server's Far Sight is out on that member's bot; BG3's own short fade ended over
void (0.1.3013.58). camera.bin's player flags gain bit 1 (the view is out on another character, patch 0040) and bit 2
(the world round the eye is loaded: the stream's focus is the eye, or the body within 100 yd of it, the load facts are
about that focus's tile, and its tile, neighbours and their placements are up and drawable). MoveLoading.lua keeps BG3's
fade over the switch until bit 2 holds with the eye at the new member.
